This perma Shadow Form build uses Sliver Armor to farm a wide variety of '''bosses''' across all campaigns in '''Hard Mode'''.

==Skills and Attributes ==
<pvxbig>
[build prof=A/E Sha=12+1+3 Ear=12 Air=3][Glyph of Swiftness][Shadow Form][Shroud of Distress][Optional][Optional][Optional][Ebon Battle Standard of Honor][Sliver Armor][/build]
</pvxbig>

==Equipment==
'''Armor'''
*Head: Blessed Shadow Arts Head Piece of Superior Shadow Arts.
*Chest: Blessed Armor of Superior Vigor.
*Arms: Blessed Armor of Attunement.
*Legs: Blessed Armor of Attunement.
*Boots: Blessed Armor of Attunement.


'''Weapon'''
* Insightful Staff of Enchanting with +5 Energy.
* Martial weapon of Enchanting with +5 Energy and a Shield of Devotion with -2 physical damage while Enchanted.
* Longbow of Enchanting.

<h4>Different Weapon Sets</h4>
*{{D}} Myish, Lady of the Lake: A Shield of Devotion with +10vs cold.

==Usage==
*Maintain Shadow Form with Glyph of Swiftness. The 2nd charge of Glyph of Swiftness should be used on Sliver Armor whenever possible.
*Glyph of Lesser Energy is for Shroud of Distress/Ebon Battle Standard of Honor/Armor of Earth.
*Spike targets with EBSoH -> Sliver Armor (ideally, EBSoH would go up before Shadow Form so that it doesn't interrupt your Glyph rotation).

